From 018d09956f450e67464c2588592871db52dd11b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: local <local@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 10:40:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 20/34] WP26: Guest pages in German, Spanish and French

Conflict resolution: PR 230 archived the Ticket Wallet guest UI, so WP26's changes to guest-ticket.css and ticket.js (which git moved onto static/archive/ticket-wallet/) are dropped and the archive stays untouched. The language menu (<details class="g-lang">, WP26's template) is styled for the active arrival-lane header in guest.css instead, replacing the old two-pill .g-lang rules; the date-of-birth field already takes its placeholder from date_placeholder in main's form.html, so the data-tw-* attributes are not added; the 320 px step-strip rule had no counterpart (the arrival lane lists steps vertically). guest.css cookie table: WP28's .scroll-x containment and WP26's phone card layout kept together, the first cell may wrap in card mode. Cache keys: guest.css 20261004z, signature.js 20261004b, guest-enhancements.js unchanged. tests/test_guest_browser_e2e.py: main's flow ("Add a person" link, done text) with the labels taken from the guest's language, plus WP26's privacy-page check; tests/test_ticket_wallet_v3.py keeps main's trimmed version. Cross-WP: WP27's privacy_first_line and its house book storage row in cookie_inventory.py get de/es/fr text, as the five-language parity tests require.
